# {{.GameName}}

A deathmatch-first standalone game built on the Ironwail-Go engine
(github.com/darkliquid/ironwail-go/sdk). `DefaultDeathmatch` is 1; set
`DefaultCoop`/`DefaultTeamplay` in `gameconfig.go` as needed.

## Commands

```sh
go mod tidy        # resolve quake + engine module replaces
go test ./...      # run the sim tests
make build         # build the game binary
make run           # build + run (from the parent dir, where ./<modname> is
                   # found; game data is loaded from ./<modname>)
```

## Item respawn

`progs/progs.go` contains `RespawnItemThink` / `ItemTouch` stubs following
`pkg/qgo/quakego` page item patterns.